{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hant",
  "language_raw": "Trad_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/dome.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Trad_Chinese/script/dome.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "dome_coast_square_npc_01",
      "hash64": "919D49A134197953",
      "text": "紫竽學姐會很親切地\\n教我寶可夢的事喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "dome_coast_square_npc_02",
      "hash64": "919D4AA134197B06",
      "text": "紫竽兒她呀，每天都會用\\n寶可夢洗澡澡３次喔。\\r\\n所以她的寶可夢總是很乾淨。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "dome_coast_square_npc_12",
      "hash64": "91A0CCA1341C8DC3",
      "text": "不管龍屬性的寶可夢再怎麼強，\\n在妖精的力量前都是不堪一擊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "dome_coast_square_npc_13",
      "hash64": "91A0CBA1341C8C10",
      "text": "雖然就屬性而言是佔上風，\\n但聽說紫竽兒從來沒有\\r\\n打贏過杜若呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "dome_coast_beach_npc_12",
      "hash64": "88589670E382166F",
      "text": "海岸區的魅力在於海！\\n這裡用的可是如假包換的海水喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "dome_coast_area3_npc_03",
      "hash64": "2339F558CE3104CA",
      "text": "巨蛋的休息站\\n有自動販賣機呢！\\r\\n在那裡可以買到各式各樣的球喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "dome_coast_area3_npc_04",
      "hash64": "2339F058CE30FC4B",
      "text": "用潛水球會比較容易捉到\\n在水中游的寶可夢喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "dome_savanna_square_npc_01",
      "hash64": "C4AA338B4EC31E19",
      "text": "堆著方塊的地方，\\n小的叫做休息站！\\r\\n大的叫做廣場喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "dome_savanna_square_npc_02",
      "hash64": "C4AA308B4EC31900",
      "text": "赤松的料理很厲害喔！\\n他會用鴨嘴炎獸的火去烤食材呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "dome_savanna_square_npc_04",
      "hash64": "C4AA368B4EC32332",
      "text": "火屬性的寶可夢\\n不會陷入灼傷狀態！\\r\\n知道這點便能和其他人拉開差距！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "dome_savanna_battlecourt_npc_03",
      "hash64": "6E3D73FB10921FD5",
      "text": "草原區有斑斑馬，\\n所以超棒的！\\c\\n只要跨到不同的區域，\\n可以遇見的寶可夢就會改變喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "dome_savanna_battlecourt_npc_05",
      "hash64": "6E3D6DFB109215A3",
      "text": "四天王戰會在各個廣場的\\n對戰場舉行喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "dome_savanna_battlecourt_npc_06",
      "hash64": "6E3D6EFB10921756",
      "text": "在藍莓聯盟要是排名不夠高，\\n就算想要挑戰四天王，也都沒辦法呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "dome_savanna_area3_npc_01",
      "hash64": "BEB0C2002490414E",
      "text": "大顎蟻進化以後，\\n就會增加龍屬性啊～\\r\\n為什麼？好不可思議喔～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "dome_savanna_area3_npc_03",
      "hash64": "BEB0C00024903DE8",
      "text": "用回復機的時候，\\n如果後面有人就會很緊張呢……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "dome_canyon_square_npc_01",
      "hash64": "FDA6CE47964390E3",
      "text": "納莉小姐又酷又出色！\\n她是學生會長，還是四天王呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "dome_canyon_square_npc_02",
      "hash64": "FDA6CF4796439296",
      "text": "峽谷區有比較多\\n粗獷的寶可夢！\\c\\n四天王納莉也會\\n派出鋼屬性寶可夢喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "dome_canyon_square_npc_03",
      "hash64": "FDA6D04796439449",
      "text": "叫做盔甲鳥的寶可夢\\n弱點很少，很難對付呢！\\c\\n在生態巨蛋牠還會是\\n飛翔計程車，真是太活躍啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "dome_canyon_area2_npc_04",
      "hash64": "0699A1637EA167A2",
      "text": "在某個地區似乎存在著\\n鋼鎧鴉的天敵。\\c\\n那一定是長得很可怕的\\n寶可夢吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "dome_canyon_area2_npc_05",
      "hash64": "0699A2637EA16955",
      "text": "就是因為喜歡鋼鎧鴉，\\n我才會和他變得要好的喔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "dome_canyon_area2_npc_07",
      "hash64": "0699A0637EA165EF",
      "text": "用喇叭啄鳥去挑戰飛翔計時賽，\\n說起來實在是太無謀了是吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "dome_canyon_area4_npc_07",
      "hash64": "4A80FA9D5988053D",
      "text": "這裡是電氣石岩窟！\\n一帶電就會讓人酥酥麻麻的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "dome_polar_square_npc_02",
      "hash64": "F5876F74DEE785DC",
      "text": "杜若他是２年級……\\n奇怪？\\c\\n我怎麼記得他去年和前年\\n也是２年級啊……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "dome_polar_area2_npc_01",
      "hash64": "EFE54481364A2A9F",
      "text": "極地區棲息著很多\\n很耐寒的寶可夢喔。\\r\\n冰屬性占的比例似乎多一些些！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_01",
      "hash64": "7010503B493C631A",
      "text": "這前面是峽谷區！\\n岩石表面凹凹凸凸的，\\r\\n所以建議[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳騎上坐騎寶可夢喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_05",
      "hash64": "70104C3B493C5C4E",
      "text": "聽說只要和大家一起藍樂活，\\n報酬就會變多！\\r\\n可是我沒有朋友可以一起參加……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_07",
      "hash64": "70104A3B493C58E8",
      "text": "這裡是中心廣場！\\n４個區域交會的地方！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_14_01",
      "hash64": "F3FAEAFDD69B1F9A",
      "text": "妳不覺得最近聯盟社的氣氛\\n有點差嗎……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_15_01",
      "hash64": "C97CD7092003AD4F",
      "text": "自從冠軍從杜若\\n變成烏栗之後……\\r\\n社團活動就不好玩了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_14_02",
      "hash64": "F3FAE9FDD69B1DE7",
      "text": "雖然這麼說不太好，\\n但我早就希望烏栗別當冠軍了。\\r\\n所以我很高興。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_15_02",
      "hash64": "C97CD8092003AF02",
      "text": "聽說新的冠軍\\n不是這個學園的人呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_14_03",
      "hash64": "F3FAE8FDD69B1C34",
      "text": "可以開開心心對戰的\\n聯盟社回來了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_15_03",
      "hash64": "C97CD9092003B0B5",
      "text": "如果是現在的社團，\\n我就有動力加油了！\\r\\n目標是當上四天王之類的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_16",
      "hash64": "700CC93B493947DE",
      "text": "巨蛋裡方塊會\\n放射出紅外線和紫外線！\\c\\n……據說那會促進\\n寶可夢和植物的成長！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_21",
      "hash64": "7016BC3B4941864C",
      "text": "那邊是極地區！\\c\\n那裡有人工重現的冰山，\\n所以很冷喔～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_35",
      "hash64": "7013BC3B493F5075",
      "text": "和團體戰有關的任務只要和大家\\n一起挑戰，就能輕鬆完成耶！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_36",
      "hash64": "7013B93B493F4B5C",
      "text": "我要和我哥哥一起\\n藍樂活喔～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_40_01",
      "hash64": "A5C7FEAD8569F2A5",
      "text": "１年級那個叫做烏栗的人，\\n整個人的氣氛突然就變了呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_40_02",
      "hash64": "A5C7FBAD8569ED8C",
      "text": "冠軍戰太精彩了。\\n烏栗想必是相當不甘心吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_40_03",
      "hash64": "A5C7FCAD8569EF3F",
      "text": "聽說烏栗他休學了。\\n希望他能快點打起精神。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_48",
      "hash64": "7002C13B4930E5C1",
      "text": "只有優秀的學生！\\n才領到了太晶珠。\\r\\n……據說是材料很貴重！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_49",
      "hash64": "7002C03B4930E40E",
      "text": "太晶化真是深奧！\\n有時還會導致弱點變多呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
