    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_50",
      "hash64": "6FFF333B492DBEA0",
      "text": "那邊是海岸區！\\n有花有海，彷彿身處阿羅拉！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_54",
      "hash64": "6FFF373B492DC56C",
      "text": "咦？難不成……\\n方塊的顏色會根據區域而有不同？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "dome_center_square_npc_56",
      "hash64": "6FFF393B492DC8D2",
      "text": "我身後有招式學習器\\n掉在地上喔。\\r\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳撿起來了沒？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
